    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>ليكن العددان a و b حيث:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br>بيّن أنّ a مقلوب b<br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>ليكن العددان a و b حيث:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br>احسب العبارة:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">c = -3(<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span></span>)</span><br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>ليكن العددان a و b حيث:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br>احسب العبارة:<br>انشر و اختصر العبارة:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = -4(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span> - 1) - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span>(<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span> + 3)</span><br><span class=\"q\">4) </span>ليكن العددان a و b حيث:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br>احسب العبارة:<br>انشر و اختصر العبارة:<br>فكّك إلى جداء عوامل العبارة، حيث x عدد حقيقي:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = (x - 2)(4x - 4) - (x - 2)(3x + 5)</span><br><span class=\"q\">5) </span>ليكن العددان a و b حيث:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span><br>احسب العبارة:<br>انشر و اختصر العبارة:<br>فكّك إلى جداء عوامل العبارة، حيث x عدد حقيقي:<br>أوجد x في حالة:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = 0</span>",
    correction: [{"quoi":"","math":"<b>1)</b>"},{"quoi":"نكتب الجداء","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a × b = (3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>)(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>)</span>"},{"quoi":"نستعمل المتطابقة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>)(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>) = (3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span>)<sup>2</sup> - (<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>)<sup>2</sup></span>"},{"quoi":"نحسب المربّعين","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span>)<sup>2</sup> - (<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>)<sup>2</sup> = 27 - 26</span>"},{"quoi":"نستنتج","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">27 - 26 = 1</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a × b = 1</span>، إذن a مقلوب b"},{"quoi":"","math":"<b>2)</b>"},{"quoi":"مقلوب a","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span></span> = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"نعوّض","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">c = -3(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>)</span>"},{"quoi":"ننشر","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">-3(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span>) = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span> - 9<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">c = 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">26</span></span> - 9<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">3</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"","math":"<b>3)</b>"},{"quoi":"ننشر القوس الأوّل","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">-4(3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span> - 1) = 4 - 12<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"ننشر القوس الثاني","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span>(<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span> + 3) = 13 + 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"نطرح","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = 4 - 12<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span> - (13 + 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span>)</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = -9 - 15<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">13</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"","math":"<b>4)</b>"},{"quoi":"نتعرّف على العامل المشترك","math":"العبارة <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(x - 2)</span> موجودة في الحدّين"},{"quoi":"نضع العامل المشترك","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = (x - 2)[(4x - 4) - (3x + 5)]</span>"},{"quoi":"نختصر ما بين المعقفين","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(4x - 4) - (3x + 5) = x - 9</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = (x - 2)(x - 9)</span>"},{"quoi":"","math":"<b>5)</b>"},{"quoi":"ننطلق من الشكل المفكّك","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = (x - 2)(x - 9)</span>"},{"quoi":"جداء معدوم","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = 0</span> يعني <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">x - 2 = 0</span> أو <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">x - 9 = 0</span>"},{"quoi":"نحلّ الحالة الأولى","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">x = 2</span>"},{"quoi":"نحلّ الحالة الثانية","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">1 × 9 - 9 = 0</span>"},{"quoi":"نتحقّق من الحلّ الثاني","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(9 - 2)(1 × 9 - 9) = 0</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">x = 2</span> أو <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">x = 9</span>"}],
